1157122\n\n[info@primonproperties.com](mailto:info@primonproperties.com)\n\n###### AGENT RERA: A51900038188\n\n## Property Details\n\nProperty Type\n\nStandalone Tower\n\nBedrooms\n\n4 BHK | 6 BHK\n\nSize\n\n2300 sqft - 5200 sqft\n\nPossession\n\nDecember 2027\n\n## Property Location\n\nBabulnath, Khareghat Colony, Gamdevi, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nFIND YOUR NEXT SPACE\n\nPrimon Properties invites you to explore a realm where real estate excellence meets personalised service. Connect with us today to embark on a journey that goes beyond properties—where dreams find their address, and excellence knows no bounds.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nFirst Name \n\nLast Name \n\nEmail \n\nPhone Number \n\nInterested in:\n\nResidential\n\n \n\nCommercial\n\n \n\nOther\n\n \n\nRequirement Details \n\nSubmit\n\nThanks for submitting!\n\n[![Image 7: Primon Properties](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/50b778_3049a6847280432a95ac734262218931~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_66,h_61,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/pp%20white%20logo.png)](https://www.primonproperties.com/about-us)\n\n© 2024 by Priyanka Babla\n\n[SERVICES](https://www.primonproperties.com/)​\n\n​\n\n[Residential Services](https://www.primonproperties.com/residential-services)\n\n​\n\n[Commercial Services](https://www.primonproperties.com/commercial-services)\n\n​\n\n[Retail Services](https://www.primonproperties.com/retail-services)\n\n​\n\n[Consultancy Services](https://www.primonproperties.com/consultancy-services)\n\n​\n\n[PROPERTIES](https://www.primonproperties.com/)\n\n​\n\n[Residential](https://www.primonproperties.com/properties)\n\n​\n\n[Commercial](https://www.primonproperties.com/properties-2)\n\n​\n\n[Second Homes](https://www.primonproperties.com/second-homes-1)\n\n​\n\n[Under Construction](https://www.primonproperties.com/properties-1)\n\nUnit 5, Matru Mandir, Ground Floor, 278, Tardeo Road, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400007\n\n​\n\nRERA: A51900038188\n\n​\n\n[info@primonproperties.com](mailto:info@primonproperti